      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Update on build 906: This is still an issue, and IMO it should be looked at for the new locomotion as well mostly because both the legacy locomotion and the new locomotion have a pretty noticeable delay between jumping when you spam space bar on beta. Whereas live doesn't have a delay I can notice. It feels clunky in beta compared to live at the moment.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
