      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "before the update, if you pressed jump a bit before you landed you would jump again. now you have to be fully grounded before you can press jump again. I personally liked the older way it worked better. most games seem to allow you to press jump slightly early. \nthis affects sdk2 and 3 worlds",
      "viewerReactions": null
