  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-01-16T04:20:43.306Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "From what I've been able to test, jumping isn't working as well as it used to. If one attempts to bunny-hop, every few hops you'll get stuck to the floor and it'll take a second before you can jump again.\nAdditionally, wall-climbing barely works in the SDK2 worlds I've tried. You can stick to walls, but when attempting to jump up them you won't be able to gain any height unless you use a macro.",
